<BaseLayout title="About — AXIOM">
  <article class="prose">
    <header class="post-header">
      <span class="mono-meta">MANIFESTO // 00</span>
      <h1 class="post-title">About AXIOM</h1>
    </header>

    <p>
      <strong>AXIOM</strong> is a living, minimalist technical index built to track emerging technologies without noise or hype. Every entry is distilled into four core dimensions:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> What fundamental bottleneck or problem the technology solves.</li>
      <li><strong>Capability:</strong> Concrete performance characteristics, pipelines, and architectural limits.</li>
      <li><strong>Industrial Use:</strong> Where it is actively deployed in production across graphics, systems, AI, and engineering.</li>
      <li><strong>References:</strong> Direct links to foundational papers, repositories, and documentation.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Design Philosophy</h2>
    <p>
      Designed with Swiss typographic discipline—high-contrast hierarchy, zero visual clutter, and plain-text Markdown longevity so the archive stays fast and readable indefinitely.
    </p>
  </article>
